Use case: photorealistic-natural. WhiskedAway countryside coastal inn, same real building as Cuddlecore. Editorial cosy-living INTERIORS PHOTOGRAPH, not render/illustration. Full-frame 24mm lens, 1.6m eye height, level verticals, f/4 reasonably sharp, ONE 16:9 landscape image. Cream #f4efe4 uneven limewashed plaster, low aged oak beams, dark honey wide floorboards, rubbed oak door wood, cream painted frames, aged brass #b07f52 and deep brown #2c2416. Faded berry #8b4d5c/cream/faded-blue woven runner. Natural chips, wear, faded textiles, no showroom polish. Same rainy late afternoon: cool soft sea-window/fanlight daylight and two modest brass wall lamps, thin warm light under a few doors. NO people, animals, text, numbers, labels, signs, logos, watermark, readable or garbled lettering. NO modern fittings, switches, radiators, smoke alarms, screens. Quiet magic belongs to light and brass only, no steampunk gears or fantasy effects.
Asset09-notice-board.png. Straight-on close-up of same cork notice board hanging in entrance hall from reference1; board ONLY with slight surrounding cream plaster, no stair/door props. Keep rough rubbed oak frame and warm natural cork, portrait board proportions, photograph all frame edges without crop. 16:9 landscape photograph with board centered, front-on and level.
EXACTLY SIX paper pieces pinned at modest different angles with small aged brass pins:
1 a small blank cream card;
2 a folded cream note opened partway, entirely blank;
3 a plain folded kraft seed packet with NO printing or marks;
4 a larger blank cream notice sheet;
5 a small soft aged blank paper slip;
6 a small cream backing sheet holding one real pressed herb leaf.
All paper surfaces completely blank or only natural faint aging/smudges, no handwriting-like strokes, lines, numbers, seedpacketlabels, stamps, logos, signatures or printed marks. Pressed leaf is actual botanical texture, not lettering. Keep attachments spaced and distinct, a lived-in practical board rather than graphic collage. Fine cork granules, creased paper edges, real pins/contact shadows and scuffed frame.
Same rainy afternoon cool fill/warm brass-lamp spill, gentle contrast, natural documentary interiors photo not CGI. No people, animals, readable OR garbled text, modern fittings, watermark.

